                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "That was fun! While not the best beat-em-up by itself, the game reproduces belowed moviews by the titular duo very well, and various mini-games add details. It even has a racing game in it! And references to Street Fighter and Streets of Rage, I think. Using music from movies is a great choice (and it's fun, good music), and really adds to the atmosphere. All in all, well worth the time!",
